@startuml swc_composition
title SWC composition - page 1: ports between SWCs (TASK-027)

note as Legend
Covers: SWC split and intra-ECU ports of swc_composition.md sections 1 and 3.2.
Arrow = data flow from the P-port Pp<Name> of the producer to the R-port Rp<Name>
of the consumer; label = port (data elements). (n) = position in OsTask_10ms;
dashed = read in the next cycle. All S/R ports are explicit, every 10 ms.
Ports that also go to Com, IoHwAb or BSW services: page 2.
end note

component "SwcSensorInput\n(3) Run10ms" as SI
component "SwcGearSelector\n(4) Run10ms" as GS
component "SwcShiftCtrl\n(5) Run10ms" as SC
component "SwcFaultMgr\n(6) Run10ms, Run100ms" as FM
component "SwcSolenoidCtrl\n(7) Run10ms" as SOL

SI --> GS : PpVehicleSpeed (VehicleSpeed)\nPpStandstill (Standstill)
SI --> SC : PpVehicleSpeed, PpStandstill\nPpShaftSpeeds (InputShaftSpeed, OutputShaftSpeed)\nPpOilTemp (OilTempPhys, OilTempValid)
SI --> FM : PpVehicleSpeed (end of Init D9, debug line)\nPpSensorFaults (ShaftSpeedInvalid, LinePressSensorFault,\nOilTempSensorFault, OilOverTemp,\nComFaultSimSpeed, ComFaultSimAnalog)
SI --> SOL : PpLinePress (LinePress, LinePressValid)
GS --> SC : PpSelectorPosition (SelectorPosition)
GS --> FM : PpSelectorFaults (SelectorFault, SelectorFaultInD,\nSelectorKnown, ComFaultSimDriver)\nPpSelectorState (SelectorState, debug line)
GS --> SOL : PpSelectorPosition\nPpLockSolenoidOut (RLS)
SC --> FM : PpShiftFaults (ShiftFault, RatioFault)\nPpGearStatus (GearTarget, GearActual, debug line)
SC --> SOL : PpGearStatus (GearTarget, ShiftInProgress)\nPpThrottle (Throttle)
FM --> SOL : PpTcuMode (mode TcuMode)\nPpFaultBits (FaultBits: bits 4, 9 suspend SYS-SEN-006)
FM ..> SC : PpTcuMode (mode TcuMode),\nread in the next cycle
SOL ..> FM : PpSolenoidFaults (PressureFault),\nread in the next cycle

note right of FM
IRVs IrvTcuMode, IrvFaultBits:
SwcFaultMgr_Run10ms -> SwcFaultMgr_Run100ms
end note

newpage

title SWC composition - page 2: ports mapped by the RTE to Com, IoHwAb and BSW services (TASK-027)

note as Legend2
Covers: RTE mapping of swc_composition.md sections 3.3 .. 3.5 (DC-01, DC-02, DC-03).
CAN-mapped data elements keep the can_matrix name and raw scaling;
the physical conversion is done in the named SWC, never in the RTE.
*In / *Out ports are mapped to Com today and to IoHwAb in the later hardware variant.
AliveCtr is handled inside Com (I-PDU callouts) and is not a port.
end note

package "Application (src/app)" {
  component "SwcSensorInput" as SI2
  component "SwcGearSelector" as GS2
  component "SwcShiftCtrl" as SC2
  component "SwcFaultMgr" as FM2
  component "SwcSolenoidCtrl" as SOL2
}

rectangle "RTE (src/rte, handwritten: copies data, maps ports, calls runnables)" {
  interface "RpDriverIn\nSelector, Brake" as DIN
  interface "RpThrottleIn\nThrottle" as TIN
  interface "RpShaftSpeedIn\nInputShaftSpeed, OutputShaftSpeed" as SIN
  interface "RpAnalogIn\nOilTempVoltage, LinePressVoltage" as AIN
  interface "PpSolenoidOut\nSS_A, SS_B, PCS_Duty" as SOUT
  interface "PpLockSolenoidOut\nRLS, SLS" as LOUT
  interface "PpFaultLampOut\nFaultLamp" as FLOUT
  interface "PpGearStatus, PpSelectorState,\nPpVehicleSpeed, PpOilTempStatus,\nPpModeStatus, PpFaultBits" as STAT
  interface "PpProgPrecond\nProgPrecondMask" as PROG
  interface "PpTcuMode (mode)" as MODE2
  interface "RpCanBusState (mode)\nCANBUS_ONLINE, CANBUS_BUSOFF" as BUSST
  interface "RpDebugOut (C/S)\nWriteLine" as DBG
  interface "RpDemEvt<Fault> (C/S, 12 ports)\nSetEventStatus" as DEM
}

package "BSW (src/bsw)" {
  component "Com" as Com
  component "IoHwAb" as IoHwAb
  component "BswM\n(TASK-030)" as BswM
  component "CanSM\n(TASK-029)" as CanSM
  component "Dcm" as Dcm
  component "Dem\n(TASK-025)" as Dem
  component "DbgOut CDD\n(TASK-031)" as DbgOut
  component "PduR / CanIf / Can" as Lower
  component "Dio" as Dio
}

GS2 ..> DIN
SC2 ..> TIN
SI2 ..> SIN
SI2 ..> AIN
SOL2 -- SOUT
GS2 -- LOUT
FM2 -- FLOUT
SI2 -- STAT
GS2 -- STAT
SC2 -- STAT
FM2 -- STAT
GS2 -- PROG
FM2 -- MODE2
FM2 ..> BUSST
FM2 ..> DBG
FM2 ..> DEM

Com --> DIN : SIM_Driver 0x100\nCom_ReceiveSignal + status
Com --> TIN : SIM_Driver 0x100
Com --> SIN : SIM_Speed 0x101
Com --> AIN : SIM_Analog 0x102
SOUT --> Com : TCU_Actuators 0x200\nCom_SendSignal
LOUT --> Com : TCU_Actuators 0x200
FLOUT --> Com : TCU_Actuators 0x200
FLOUT --> IoHwAb : FaultLampLed\n(same value)
STAT --> Com : TCU_Status 0x201
PROG --> Dcm : read by Dcm\n(10 02, RID 0x0203)
MODE2 --> BswM : Rte_Mode
BswM --> BUSST : Rte_Switch
DBG --> DbgOut : WriteLine
DEM --> Dem : Dem_SetEventStatus

CanSM --> BswM : BswM_CanSM_CurrentState
Dcm --> BswM : BswM_Dcm_CommunicationMode_CurrentState (28)
BswM --> Com : TCU_Tx I-PDU group start / stop
Com --> Lower
Lower --> CanSM : bus-off indication
IoHwAb --> Dio : red LED, GPIO0 pin 10, active low
@enduml
